Branch: REL_10_STABLE [06a2b2fe5] 2021-06-28 14:17:42 -0400
Branch: REL9_6_STABLE [b54be47cd] 2021-06-28 14:17:42 -0400
-->
     <para>不要因 libpq 打印函数中的内存不足而中止进程（Tom Lane）</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
