     <para>在 <application>ecpg</application> 中，允许将 <type>numeric</type> 值 <systemitem>INT_MIN</systemitem>（通常为 -2147483648）转换为整数（John Naylor）</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master Release: REL_14_BR [42f94f56b] 2021-06-07 14:15:25 -0400
Branch: REL_13_STABLE [5b6436874] 2021-06-07 14:15:25 -0400
