Branch: REL9_5_STABLE [5f9eace5d] 2020-03-23 11:58:01 -0400
-->
     <para>修复 <application>ecpg</application>，使其在所有平台上都将仅包含 <quote><literal>-</literal></quote> 的参数解释为<quote>从 stdin 读取</quote>（Tom Lane）</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
