     <para>为 <application>pg_dump</application> 增加对 <command>ALTER ... DEPENDS ON EXTENSION</command> 的支持（&Aacute;lvaro Herrera）</para>

     <para><application>pg_dump</application> 以前忽略了以这种方式添加的依赖关系，导致它们在转储/恢复或 <application>pg_upgrade</application> 期间丢失。</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
