Branch: REL9_5_STABLE [d9ec8d1d7] 2020-02-17 18:40:02 -0500
-->
     <para>修复 <application>pg_dump</application>，使其转储 RLS 策略对象上的注释（Tom Lane）</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
