     <para>避免大事务必须溢写到许多独立临时文件时逻辑解码发生失败（Amit Khandekar）</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [4d9ceb001] 2019-11-22 11:31:19 -0500
