     <para>修复可能报告不正确错误码的各种错误处理代码路径（Michael Paquier，Tom Lane，Magnus Hagander）</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master Release: REL_11_BR [dddfc4cb2] 2018-04-03 16:26:05 -0400
