     <para>修复 <filename>contrib/pageinspect</filename> 的 <function>hash_page_items()</function> 函数输出不正确的问题（Masahiko Sawada）</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
