-->
     <para>在 <filename>contrib/postgres_fdw</filename> 中，避免存在重复 <literal>GROUP BY</literal> 条目时规划器失败（Jeevan Chalke）</para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [ac3b96268] 2017-11-17 12:46:52 -0500
